# Operate

<Aside title="Reserved — coming when ServiceCard ships" data-variant="not">

Operate recipes will be added as the ServiceCard and TriggerCard runtime
contracts ship. The specs are authored; the runtime implementation is not yet
available.

</Aside>

Operate capability covers:

- Deploying a service governed by a `ServiceCard`
- Triggering workflows from `TriggerCard` definitions
- Managing operator lifecycle within a workflow

These how-to pages will be added alongside the ServiceCard runtime. See what
runs today in the [Overview](/overview/).
